AUDIO: 'turn off the Mesh and Point Cloud outputs if&nbsp; you don\'t need them. Hit \'Start Reconstruction\'.&nbsp;&nbsp; After the process finish, your realistic&nbsp; Gaussian Splatting scene is ready. You can&nbsp;&nbsp;'

